{"data":{"current_mention_tongjian_id":"8c27e66d-db0e-11ef-b977-a0d3651f611f","current_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8c27e657-db0e-11ef-a241-a0d3651f611f","occurrence_page":{"anchor_paragraph_order":0,"current_page":1,"items":[{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"齊州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[{"relation_type":"explicit_reference","source_end_index":21,"source_start_index":5,"source_text":"見一百二十五卷宋文帝元嘉二十四年","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"a86f54b0-db0e-11ef-8e81-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"武昌王","people_name_jianti_auto":"武昌王","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"aa1870a0-db0e-11ef-94b9-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"提","people_name_jianti_auto":"提","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"aa1870a1-db0e-11ef-a085-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"宋文帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"宋文帝","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"aa1870a2-db0e-11ef-976b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"武昌王提，見一百二十五卷宋文帝元嘉二十四年。","note_content_jianti_auto":"武昌王提，见一百二十五卷宋文帝元嘉二十四年。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"aa18709f-db0e-11ef-82ba-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"齊州","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐州","resolved_place_entity_id":27,"start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"aa1870a9-db0e-11ef-b7ee-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"25是歲，魏妖人劉舉聚衆自稱天子。齊州刺史武昌王平原討斬之。平原，提之子也。","content_fanyi":"这一年，北魏妖人刘举聚众自称天子。齐州刺史武昌王拓跋平原加以讨伐，将刘举斩杀。拓跋平原是拓跋提之子。","content_jianti_auto":"25是岁，魏妖人刘举聚众自称天子。齐州刺史武昌王平原讨斩之。平原，提之子也。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":12511,"number":25,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百三十三 (宋紀十五) / 蒼梧王上 / 元徽元年 / 第 27 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"aa18709d-db0e-11ef-9cf2-a0d3651f611f","year_int":473},"tongjian_id":"aa18709d-db0e-11ef-9cf2-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"齊州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"齊州","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐州","resolved_place_entity_id":27,"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"aa8d0082-db0e-11ef-9059-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"齊州刺中韓麒麟，爲政尚寬，從事劉普慶說麒麟曰：「公杖節方夏，而無所誅斬，何以示威！」麒麟曰：「刑罰所以止惡，仁者不得已而用之。今民不犯法，又何誅乎？若必斷斬然後可以立威，當以卿應之！」普慶慚懼而起。","content_fanyi":"齐州刺史韩麒麟为政崇尚宽和，从事刘普庆劝韩麒麟说：“您持节镇守一方，却未曾诛杀一人，如何显示威严！”韩麒麟说：“刑罚是用来制止恶行的，仁德之人不得已才使用它。如今百姓不犯法，又去诛杀谁呢？如果一定要靠斩杀才能树立威信，就该拿你来应验！”刘普庆惭愧恐惧，起身离去。","content_jianti_auto":"齐州刺中韩麒麟，为政尚宽，从事刘普庆说麒麟曰：「公杖节方夏，而无所诛斩，何以示威！」麒麟曰：「刑罚所以止恶，仁者不得已而用之。今民不犯法，又何诛乎？若必断斩然后可以立威，当以卿应之！」普庆惭惧而起。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":12848,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百三十五 (齊紀一) / 世祖武皇帝上之上 / 永明元年 / 第 36 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"aa8d007b-db0e-11ef-a642-a0d3651f611f","year_int":483},"tongjian_id":"aa8d007b-db0e-11ef-a642-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":2},{"mention_count":2,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"齊州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"古者，三年耕，餘一年食；九年耕，餘三年食。以三十年之通制國用，則當有九年之蓄。國無九年之蓄曰不足，無六年之蓄曰急，無三年之蓄曰國非其國也。稔，而廩翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"古者，三年耕，余一年食；九年耕，余三年食。以三十年之通制国用，则当有九年之蓄。国无九年之蓄曰不足，无六年之蓄曰急，无三年之蓄曰国非其国也。稔，而廪翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":60,"tongjian_id":"aab7267b-db0e-11ef-8b18-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"aab7267d-db0e-11ef-a457-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"漢令民入粟拜爵。又有孝悌力田之科。","note_content_jianti_auto":"汉令民入粟拜爵。又有孝悌力田之科。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":88,"tongjian_id":"aab7267c-db0e-11ef-affa-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"袨，黃練翻；袨服，美衣也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"袨，黄练翻；袨服，美衣也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":140,"tongjian_id":"aab7267e-db0e-11ef-b0a1-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"張晏","people_name_jianti_auto":"张晏","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"aab72680-db0e-11ef-a85b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"張晏曰：玉食，珍食也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"张晏曰：玉食，珍食也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":150,"tongjian_id":"aab7267f-db0e-11ef-907f-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"少，詩沼翻；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"少，诗沼翻；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":170,"tongjian_id":"aab72681-db0e-11ef-9876-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"毛晃","people_name_jianti_auto":"毛晃","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"aab72684-db0e-11ef-b6c6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"毛晃曰：貫，鄕籍也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"毛晃曰：贯，鄕籍也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":261,"tongjian_id":"aab72683-db0e-11ef-8eaf-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"歲入約少爲儉。賑，之忍翻；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"岁入约少为俭。赈，之忍翻；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":336,"tongjian_id":"aab72686-db0e-11ef-85d0-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"aab72689-db0e-11ef-a8fd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"平城","place_name_jianti_auto":"平城","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"aab7268a-db0e-11ef-ac4c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"魏都平城，郊畿之外，置關於要路以譏征。","note_content_jianti_auto":"魏都平城，郊畿之外，置关于要路以讥征。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":384,"tongjian_id":"aab72688-db0e-11ef-bff9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"齊州","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐州","resolved_place_entity_id":27,"start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"aab7268e-db0e-11ef-987c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"齊州","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐州","resolved_place_entity_id":27,"start_index":269,"tongjian_id":"aab72690-db0e-11ef-abbe-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"魏春夏大旱，代地尤甚；加以牛疫，民餒死者多。六月，癸未，詔內外之臣極言無隱。齊州刺史韓麒麟上表曰：「古先哲王，儲積九稔；逮於中代，亦崇斯業，入粟者與斬敵同爵，力田者與孝悌均賞。今京師民庶，不田者多，遊食之口，參分居二。自承平日久，豐穰積年，競相矜夸，遂成侈俗。貴富之家，童妾袨服，工商之族，僕隸玉食；而農夫闕糟糠，蠶婦乏短褐。故令耕者日少，田有荒蕪；穀帛罄於府庫，寶貨盈於市里；衣食匱於室，麗服溢於路。飢寒之本，實在於斯。愚謂凡珍異之物，皆宜禁斷；吉凶之禮，備爲格式；勸課農桑，嚴加賞罰。數年之中，必有盈贍。往年校比戶貫，租賦輕少。臣所統齊州，租粟纔可給俸，略無入倉，雖於民爲利而不可長久，脫有戎役，或遭天災，恐供給之方，無所取濟。可減絹布，增益穀租；年豐多積，歲儉出賑。所謂私民之穀，寄積於官，官有宿積，則民無荒年矣。」秋，七月，己丑，詔有司開倉賑貸，聽民出關就食。遣使者造籍，分遣去留，所過給糧廩，所至三長贍養之。","content_fanyi":"北魏春夏两季大旱，代郡地区尤其严重；又加上牛疫流行，百姓饿死的人很多。六月二十九日癸未，朝廷下诏命内外大臣直言极谏，不要隐讳。齐州刺史韩麒麟上表说：古代贤哲君王，总是储备九年粮食；到了中古时代，也崇尚这一做法，缴纳粮食的人与斩敌立功者授予同等爵位，努力耕作的人与孝顺父母、友爱兄弟者同样受赏。如今京城百姓中，不种田的人很多，不劳而食的人占三分之二。自从天下太平已久，连年丰收，人们竞相炫耀，便形成了奢侈的风气。富贵人家的孩童、婢女身穿华服，工商业人家的奴仆吃着精美饭食；而农夫连糟糠都缺乏，蚕妇连粗布短衣都穿不上。因此使耕作的人一天天减少，田地有的荒芜；官府仓库里的粮食布帛已经耗尽，集市里却堆满珍奇货物；家中衣食匮乏，道路上却满是华美衣服。饥寒的根本，确实就在这里。我认为凡属珍奇异物，都应一律禁止；吉礼凶礼，应规定完备的程式；鼓励督促农耕蚕桑，严明赏罚。几年之内，必定会有盈余。往年核查户籍时，租赋已经较轻较少。臣所统辖的齐州，所收粮食仅够发给官员俸禄，几乎没有剩余入仓，虽然对百姓有利，却不能长久，假若发生战事，或遭遇天灾，恐怕供给所需将无处取得接济。可以减少绢布征收，增加粮食租税；丰收年份多储备，歉收年份拿出赈济。这就是所谓把百姓的粮食寄存积聚在官府，官府有了积储，百姓就不会有荒年了。秋季七月己丑日，孝文帝下诏，命有关部门打开官仓赈济或借贷给饥民，允许饥民出关寻找食物。派遣使者编制户籍，分别遣送该离开和该留下的人，饥民经过之处由当地官府供给口粮，所到之处由当地的邻长、里长、党长供养。","content_jianti_auto":"魏春夏大旱，代地尤甚；加以牛疫，民馁死者多。六月，癸未，诏内外之臣极言无隐。齐州刺史韩麒麟上表曰：「古先哲王，储积九稔；逮于中代，亦崇斯业，入粟者与斩敌同爵，力田者与孝悌均赏。今京师民庶，不田者多，游食之口，参分居二。自承平日久，丰穰积年，竞相矜夸，遂成侈俗。贵富之家，童妾袨服，工商之族，仆隶玉食；而农夫阙糟糠，蚕妇乏短褐。故令耕者日少，田有荒芜；谷帛罄于府库，宝货盈于市里；衣食匮于室，丽服溢于路。饥寒之本，实在于斯。愚谓凡珍异之物，皆宜禁断；吉凶之礼，备为格式；劝课农桑，严加赏罚。数年之中，必有盈赡。往年校比户贯，租赋轻少。臣所统齐州，租粟才可给俸，略无入仓，虽于民为利而不可长久，脱有戎役，或遭天灾，恐供给之方，无所取济。可减绢布，增益谷租；年丰多积，岁俭出赈。所谓私民之谷，寄积于官，官有宿积，则民无荒年矣。」秋，七月，己丑，诏有司开仓赈贷，听民出关就食。遣使者造籍，分遣去留，所过给粮廪，所至三长赡养之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":12925,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百三十六 (齊紀二) / 世祖武皇帝上之下 / 五年 / 第 10 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"aab7267a-db0e-11ef-bd48-a0d3651f611f","year_int":487},"tongjian_id":"aab7267a-db0e-11ef-bd48-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":3},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"齊州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[{"chapter_global_index":5,"chapter_name":"避讳篇第五","chenzhu_chapter":"避讳为民国以前吾国特有之体制，故史书上之记载，有待于以避讳解释者甚众，不讲避讳学，不足以读中国之史也，吾昔撰《史讳举例》问世，职为是焉。胡身之生避讳最盛之朝，熟谙避讳掌故。其撰《通鉴释文辨误後序》，谓：“海陵所刊公休《释文》，以乌桓为乌元。宋朝钦宗讳桓，靖康之初，公休没久矣，安得预为钦宗讳！”即利用避讳以证史书伪讬之一法。其注《通鉴》，以避讳为训释者尤多。兹所采不过数十条，而避讳常识已略具于是矣。","chenzhu_index_in_chapter":17,"chenzhu_text":"此二条之“我朝”、“我宋”，可与《本朝篇》参照。","created_at":"2025-12-31 08:50:44","seq_in_chapter":50,"tongjian_id":"CH05-CZ017"}],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"宣祖","people_name_jianti_auto":"宣祖","start_index":74,"tongjian_id":"ac6b2593-db0e-11ef-a152-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"ac6b2594-db0e-11ef-b931-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蠻","place_name_jianti_auto":"蛮","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"ac6b2595-db0e-11ef-8f7e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"邊城","place_name_jianti_auto":"边城","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"ac6b2596-db0e-11ef-b0bc-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"建安","place_name_jianti_auto":"建安","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"ac6b2597-db0e-11ef-bd31-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"邊城郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"边城郡","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"ac6b2598-db0e-11ef-aa2e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"期思","place_name_jianti_auto":"期思","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"ac6b2599-db0e-11ef-99d2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"建安","place_name_jianti_auto":"建安","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"ac6b259a-db0e-11ef-8756-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"隋","place_name_jianti_auto":"隋","start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"ac6b259b-db0e-11ef-b22e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"期思縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"期思县","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"ac6b259c-db0e-11ef-9504-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"殷城縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"殷城县","start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"ac6b259d-db0e-11ef-8f5d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"殷城","place_name_jianti_auto":"殷城","start_index":55,"tongjian_id":"ac6b259e-db0e-11ef-b30e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"宋","place_name_jianti_auto":"宋","start_index":61,"tongjian_id":"ac6b259f-db0e-11ef-9c2d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"殷城","place_name_jianti_auto":"殷城","start_index":67,"tongjian_id":"ac6b25a0-db0e-11ef-9b1f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"商城","place_name_jianti_auto":"商城","start_index":70,"tongjian_id":"ac6b25a1-db0e-11ef-8612-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"光州","place_name_jianti_auto":"光州","start_index":85,"tongjian_id":"ac6b25a2-db0e-11ef-bb36-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"固始縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"固始县","start_index":87,"tongjian_id":"ac6b25a3-db0e-11ef-94ae-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"北史曰：魏正光中，羣蠻出山居邊城、建安者八九千戶。邊城郡治期思，則建安戍亦當相近。隋改期思縣爲殷城縣，取縣東古殷城爲名。我宋建隆元年改殷城爲商城，避宣祖諱也；後省爲鎭，入光州固始縣。","note_content_jianti_auto":"北史曰：魏正光中，群蛮出山居边城、建安者八九千户。边城郡治期思，则建安戍亦当相近。隋改期思县为殷城县，取县东古殷城为名。我宋建隆元年改殷城为商城，避宣祖讳也；后省为镇，入光州固始县。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"ac6b2592-db0e-11ef-b611-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"裴叔業","people_name_jianti_auto":"裴叔业","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"ac6b25a6-db0e-11ef-b32b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"席法友","people_name_jianti_auto":"席法友","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"ac6b25a7-db0e-11ef-ae51-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"河東","place_name_jianti_auto":"河东","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"ac6b25a8-db0e-11ef-b64e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"安定","place_name_jianti_auto":"安定","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"ac6b25a9-db0e-11ef-8493-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"襄陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"襄阳","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"ac6b25aa-db0e-11ef-afe5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"裴叔業本河東人，席法友安定人，不同州部；蓋並僑居襄陽，遂爲鄕曲。","note_content_jianti_auto":"裴叔业本河东人，席法友安定人，不同州部；盖并侨居襄阳，遂为鄕曲。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":66,"tongjian_id":"ac6b25a5-db0e-11ef-9ed6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"齊州","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐州","resolved_place_entity_id":27,"start_index":132,"tongjian_id":"ac6b25c2-db0e-11ef-82b2-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、应天府（卷二十）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"三年，萧衍逼建康，琅邪城主张本以城降。梁天监五年，萧宏伐...","context_before":"...，魏人南寇，中外纂严，命陈显达往来新亭、白下，以张声势。","source_end_index":638,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"fe324dfb-d970-553b-8d45-b6ad49aa602b","source_start_index":605,"source_text":"永元二年，裴叔业以寿阳降魏，诏崔慧景将水军进讨，齐主出琅邪城送之。"}],"path":"南直方舆纪要/一、应天府（卷二十）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"魏兵未渡淮，己亥，裴叔業病卒，僚佐多欲推司馬李元護監州，一二日謀不定。前建安戍主安定席法友等以元護非其鄕曲，恐有異志，共推裴植監州，祕叔業喪問，敎命處分，皆出於植。奚康生至，植乃開門納魏兵，城庫管籥，悉付康生。康生集城內耆舊，宣詔撫賚之。魏以植爲兗州刺史，李元護爲齊州刺史，席法友爲豫州刺史，軍主京兆王世弼爲南徐州刺史。","content_fanyi":"北魏军队尚未渡过淮河，己亥日，裴叔业患病去世，僚佐们大多想推举司马李元护来监理州事，但一两天内商议未定。前任建安戍主、安定人席法友等人认为李元护不是自己的同乡，担心他有二心，便一起推举裴植监理州事，瞒住裴叔业的死讯，教令和事务处置都由裴植发出。奚康生到达后，裴植就打开城门，迎入北魏军队，把城中仓库的钥匙全部交给康生。康生召集城内年高有声望的人，宣布诏书，抚慰赏赐他们。北魏任命裴植为兖州刺史，李元护为齐州刺史，席法友为豫州刺史，军主京兆人王世弼为南徐州刺史。","content_jianti_auto":"魏兵未渡淮，己亥，裴叔业病卒，僚佐多欲推司马李元护监州，一二日谋不定。前建安戍主安定席法友等以元护非其鄕曲，恐有异志，共推裴植监州，秘叔业丧问，教命处分，皆出于植。奚康生至，植乃开门纳魏兵，城库管籥，悉付康生。康生集城内耆旧，宣诏抚赉之。魏以植为兖州刺史，李元护为齐州刺史，席法友为豫州刺史，军主京兆王世弼为南徐州刺史。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":13491,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百四十三 (齊紀九) / 東昏侯下 / 永元二年 / 第 6 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"ac6b2590-db0e-11ef-a32b-a0d3651f611f","year_int":500},"tongjian_id":"ac6b2590-db0e-11ef-a32b-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":4},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"齊州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"光","people_name_jianti_auto":"光","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"adb0182a-db0e-11ef-9794-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"以光擁立之功也。爲，于僞翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"以光拥立之功也。为，于伪翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":57,"tongjian_id":"adb01829-db0e-11ef-9a4c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"齊州","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐州","resolved_place_entity_id":27,"start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"adb01831-db0e-11ef-8084-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"10魏平恩文宣公崔光疾篤，魏主親撫視之，拜其子勵爲齊州刺史，爲之撤樂，罷遊眺。丁酉，光卒，帝臨，哭之慟，爲減常膳。","content_fanyi":"北魏平恩文宣公崔光病势沉重，孝明帝亲自前去探望抚慰，任命他的儿子崔励为齐州刺史，并因崔光病重而撤去奏乐，停止游乐观赏。丁酉日，崔光去世，孝明帝亲临吊唁，哭得十分悲痛，为此减少了日常饮食。","content_jianti_auto":"10魏平恩文宣公崔光疾笃，魏主亲抚视之，拜其子励为齐州刺史，为之撤乐，罢游眺。丁酉，光卒，帝临，哭之恸，为减常膳。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":14154,"number":10,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百四十九 (梁紀五) / 高祖武皇帝五 / 四年 / 第 14 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"adb01828-db0e-11ef-bb5e-a0d3651f611f","year_int":523},"tongjian_id":"adb01828-db0e-11ef-bb5e-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":5},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"齊州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"任城王","people_name_jianti_auto":"任城王","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"addd1cec-db0e-11ef-961d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"雲","people_name_jianti_auto":"云","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"addd1ced-db0e-11ef-a787-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"澄","people_name_jianti_auto":"澄","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"addd1cee-db0e-11ef-90eb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"addd1cef-db0e-11ef-92f3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"任城王雲及澄，魏宗室之賢王也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"任城王云及澄，魏宗室之贤王也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":92,"tongjian_id":"addd1ceb-db0e-11ef-b8a0-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"朱元晦","people_name_jianti_auto":"朱元晦","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"addd1cf2-db0e-11ef-ba7e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"憮，罔甫翻。朱元晦曰：憮然，猶悵然。","note_content_jianti_auto":"怃，罔甫翻。朱元晦曰：怃然，犹怅然。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":166,"tongjian_id":"addd1cf1-db0e-11ef-80d1-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"伊闕","place_name_jianti_auto":"伊阙","place_note":"洛阳城南","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"addd1cf4-db0e-11ef-add0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河南","place_name_jianti_auto":"河南","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"addd1cf5-db0e-11ef-aa19-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"新城縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"新城县","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"addd1cf6-db0e-11ef-b0a9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"隋","place_name_jianti_auto":"隋","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"addd1cf7-db0e-11ef-a13d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"新城縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"新城县","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"addd1cf8-db0e-11ef-8bfa-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"伊闕縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"伊阙县","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"addd1cf9-db0e-11ef-a9f2-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"伊闕在河南新城縣界，隋開皇初，改新城縣爲伊闕縣。幾，居豈翻。降，戶江翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"伊阙在河南新城县界，隋开皇初，改新城县为伊阙县。几，居岂翻。降，户江翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":198,"tongjian_id":"addd1cf3-db0e-11ef-ad50-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"同","people_name_jianti_auto":"同","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"addd1cfc-db0e-11ef-9775-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"幽州","place_name_jianti_auto":"幽州","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"addd1cfd-db0e-11ef-9cd4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"去年，同爲幽州刺史。","note_content_jianti_auto":"去年，同为幽州刺史。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":289,"tongjian_id":"addd1cfb-db0e-11ef-8861-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"齊州","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐州","resolved_place_entity_id":27,"start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"addd1d00-db0e-11ef-8f8d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"先是給事黃門侍郞元順以剛直忤义意，出爲齊州刺史；太后徵還，爲侍中。侍坐於太后，义妻在太后側，順指之曰：「陛下柰何以一妹之故，不正元义之罪，使天下不得伸其冤憤！」太后嘿然。順，澄之子也。他日，太后從容謂侍臣曰：「劉騰、元义昔嘗邀朕求鐵券，冀得不死，朕賴不與。」韓子熙曰：「事關生殺，豈繫鐵券！且陛下昔雖不與，何解今日不殺！」太后憮然。未幾，有告「义及弟瓜謀誘六鎭降戶反於定州，又招魯陽諸蠻侵擾伊闕，欲爲內應。」得其手書，太后猶未忍殺之。羣臣固執不已，魏主亦以爲言，太后乃從之，賜义及弟瓜死於家，猶贈叉义驃騎大將軍、儀同三司、尚書令。江陽王繼廢於家，病卒。前幽州刺史盧同坐义黨除名。","content_fanyi":"此前，给事黄门侍郎元顺因刚直而不合元义心意，被外放为齐州刺史；胡太后又将他召回朝中，任命为侍中。元顺陪胡太后坐在殿中，元义的妻子坐在太后身旁，元顺指着她说：“陛下为何因为一个妹妹的缘故，不依法惩办元义的罪行，使天下之人不能伸张冤愤！”胡太后沉默不语。元顺是元澄的儿子。有一天，胡太后闲谈时对侍臣们说：“刘腾和元义过去曾向朕请求赐给铁券，希望以此免除死罪，朕幸亏没有给。”韩子熙说：“事关生杀，岂能由铁券决定！况且陛下当初虽然没有给，又怎能解释今天不杀他！”太后怅然不已。不久，有人上告说：“元义和弟弟元瓜密谋引诱六镇降户在定州反叛，又招来鲁阳各蛮族侵扰伊阙，准备做内应。”得到元义的亲笔谋反书信后，胡太后仍不忍心杀他。群臣坚持不肯罢休，魏孝明帝也主张杀掉他，胡太后这才听从，下诏赐元义和弟弟元瓜在家中自尽，但仍追赠元义骠骑大将军、仪同三司、尚书令。元义的父亲江阳王元继被废黜在家，后来病死。前幽州刺史卢同因系元义同党获罪，被除名。","content_jianti_auto":"先是给事黄门侍郞元顺以刚直忤义意，出为齐州刺史；太后征还，为侍中。侍坐于太后，义妻在太后侧，顺指之曰：「陛下柰何以一妹之故，不正元义之罪，使天下不得伸其冤愤！」太后嘿然。顺，澄之子也。他日，太后从容谓侍臣曰：「刘腾、元义昔尝邀朕求铁券，冀得不死，朕赖不与。」韩子熙曰：「事关生杀，岂系铁券！且陛下昔虽不与，何解今日不杀！」太后怃然。未几，有告「义及弟瓜谋诱六镇降户反于定州，又招鲁阳诸蛮侵扰伊阙，欲为内应。」得其手书，太后犹未忍杀之。群臣固执不已，魏主亦以为言，太后乃从之，赐义及弟瓜死于家，犹赠叉义骠骑大将军、仪同三司、尚书令。江阳王继废于家，病卒。前幽州刺史卢同坐义党除名。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":14234,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百五十 (梁紀六) / 高祖武皇帝六 / 六年 / 第 26 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"addd1ce8-db0e-11ef-9ca6-a0d3651f611f","year_int":525},"tongjian_id":"addd1ce8-db0e-11ef-9ca6-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":6},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"齊州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"宋武帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"宋武帝","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"ae0349e6-db0e-11ef-a08d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"平原郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"平原郡","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"ae0349e7-db0e-11ef-af3a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"梁鄒","place_name_jianti_auto":"梁邹","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"ae0349e8-db0e-11ef-83a2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"冀州","place_name_jianti_auto":"冀州","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"ae0349e9-db0e-11ef-8ddd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"ae0349ea-db0e-11ef-b8bc-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"冀州","place_name_jianti_auto":"冀州","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"ae0349eb-db0e-11ef-ab93-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"齊州","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐州","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"ae0349ec-db0e-11ef-b974-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"平原","place_name_jianti_auto":"平原","place_note":"东平原•山东邹平北","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"ae0349ed-db0e-11ef-b145-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東平原郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"东平原郡","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"ae0349ee-db0e-11ef-a3e0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"宋武帝僑置平原郡於梁鄒，屬冀州；後入於魏，改冀州爲齊州，平原爲東平原郡。","note_content_jianti_auto":"宋武帝侨置平原郡于梁邹，属冀州；后入于魏，改冀州为齐州，平原为东平原郡。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"ae0349e5-db0e-11ef-aa1d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"齊州","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐州","resolved_place_entity_id":27,"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"ae0349f2-db0e-11ef-b03a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"34魏齊州平原民劉樹等反，攻陷郡縣，頻敗州軍，刺史元欣以平原房士達爲將，討平之。","content_fanyi":"北魏齐州平原郡百姓刘树等人起兵造反，接连攻陷郡县，屡次打败州军，刺史元欣任命平原人房士达为将，征讨并平定了叛乱。","content_jianti_auto":"34魏齐州平原民刘树等反，攻陷郡县，频败州军，刺史元欣以平原房士达为将，讨平之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":14305,"number":34,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百五十一 (梁紀七) / 高祖武皇帝七 / 普通七年 / 第 39 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"ae0349e4-db0e-11ef-9a3e-a0d3651f611f","year_int":526},"tongjian_id":"ae0349e4-db0e-11ef-9a3e-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":7},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"齊州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"宋武帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"宋武帝","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"ae07e468-db0e-11ef-b942-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"清河郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"清河郡","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"ae07e469-db0e-11ef-aa87-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"盤陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"盘阳","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"ae07e46a-db0e-11ef-b401-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"冀州","place_name_jianti_auto":"冀州","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"ae07e46b-db0e-11ef-a4f8-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"ae07e46c-db0e-11ef-b9cd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東清河郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"东清河郡","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"ae07e46d-db0e-11ef-96c4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"齊州","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐州","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"ae07e46e-db0e-11ef-a522-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"齊州","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐州","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"ae07e46f-db0e-11ef-a59c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"長山縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"长山县","start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"ae07e470-db0e-11ef-9257-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"清河","place_name_jianti_auto":"清河","start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"ae07e471-db0e-11ef-b821-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"平原","place_name_jianti_auto":"平原","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"ae07e472-db0e-11ef-a61b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"宋武帝僑置清河郡於盤陽，屬冀州，後入于魏，爲東清河郡，屬齊州。五代志，齊州長山縣，清河、平原二郡倂入焉。","note_content_jianti_auto":"宋武帝侨置清河郡于盘阳，属冀州，后入于魏，为东清河郡，属齐州。五代志，齐州长山县，清河、平原二郡倂入焉。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"ae07e467-db0e-11ef-8f41-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"齊州","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐州","resolved_place_entity_id":27,"start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"ae07e478-db0e-11ef-bc75-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"10魏東清河郡山賊羣起，詔以齊州長史房景伯爲東清河太守。郡民劉簡虎嘗無禮於景伯，舉家亡去，景伯窮捕，禽之，署其子爲西曹掾，令諭山賊。賊以景伯不念舊惡，皆相帥出降。","content_fanyi":"北魏东清河郡山贼群起作乱，北魏朝廷诏令齐州长史房景伯担任东清河太守。东清河郡百姓刘简虎曾经对房景伯无礼，举家逃亡，房景伯到处搜捕，将他抓获，任命他的儿子为西曹掾，让他去晓谕山贼。山贼见房景伯不念旧恶，都相继出来投降。","content_jianti_auto":"10魏东清河郡山贼群起，诏以齐州长史房景伯为东清河太守。郡民刘简虎尝无礼于景伯，举家亡去，景伯穷捕，禽之，署其子为西曹掾，令谕山贼。贼以景伯不念旧恶，皆相帅出降。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":14317,"number":10,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百五十一 (梁紀七) / 高祖武皇帝七 / 大通元年 / 第 10 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"ae07e466-db0e-11ef-b570-a0d3651f611f","year_int":527},"tongjian_id":"ae07e466-db0e-11ef-b570-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":8},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"齊州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"宋武帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"宋武帝","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"ae0a2e6b-db0e-11ef-9395-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"廣川郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"广川郡","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"ae0a2e6c-db0e-11ef-abfc-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"冀州","place_name_jianti_auto":"冀州","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"ae0a2e6d-db0e-11ef-af49-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"ae0a2e6e-db0e-11ef-a219-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"齊州","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐州","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"ae0a2e6f-db0e-11ef-8057-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"齊州","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐州","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"ae0a2e70-db0e-11ef-b956-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"長山縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"长山县","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"ae0a2e71-db0e-11ef-afb3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"武強","place_name_jianti_auto":"武强","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"ae0a2e72-db0e-11ef-8866-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"廣川郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"广川郡","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"ae0a2e73-db0e-11ef-91dc-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"宋武帝僑置廣川郡，屬冀州，入魏屬齊州。五代志，齊州長山縣，舊曰武強，置廣川郡。","note_content_jianti_auto":"宋武帝侨置广川郡，属冀州，入魏属齐州。五代志，齐州长山县，旧曰武强，置广川郡。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"ae0a2e6a-db0e-11ef-b41c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"魏收","people_name_jianti_auto":"魏收","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"ae0a2e76-db0e-11ef-b636-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"東清河郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"东清河郡","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"ae0a2e77-db0e-11ef-b45d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"武城縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"武城县","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"ae0a2e78-db0e-11ef-8ce8-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"昌國城","place_name_jianti_auto":"昌国城","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"ae0a2e79-db0e-11ef-b530-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"魏收志，東清河郡武城縣有昌國城。","note_content_jianti_auto":"魏收志，东清河郡武城县有昌国城。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"ae0a2e75-db0e-11ef-acc3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"齊州","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐州","resolved_place_entity_id":27,"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"ae0ab78b-db0e-11ef-b443-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、济南府（卷三十一）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"高齐时县废。又莱芜故城，在县东南六十里。或云：汉县盖置于...","context_before":"...乐毅，号为昌国君。汉置昌国县，属齐郡。晋、宋及后魏因之。","source_end_index":115,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"35b0d111-3e98-5061-b0a6-15609de0e126","source_start_index":81,"source_text":"《北史》：魏孝昌三年，淯河民房顷作乱，据昌国城，时东清河郡治般阳也。"}],"path":"山东方舆纪要/一、济南府（卷三十一）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"17魏齊州廣川民劉鈞聚衆反，自署大行臺；清河民房項自署大都督，屯據昌國城。","content_fanyi":"北魏齐州广川的平民刘钧聚众造反，自任大行台；清河百姓房项自任大都督，屯兵占据昌国城。","content_jianti_auto":"17魏齐州广川民刘钧聚众反，自署大行台；清河民房项自署大都督，屯据昌国城。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":14325,"number":17,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百五十一 (梁紀七) / 高祖武皇帝七 / 大通元年 / 第 18 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"ae0a2e69-db0e-11ef-a327-a0d3651f611f","year_int":527},"tongjian_id":"ae0a2e69-db0e-11ef-a327-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":9},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"齊州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"高祐","people_name_jianti_auto":"高祐","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"ae2fd777-db0e-11ef-8488-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"允","people_name_jianti_auto":"允","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"ae2fd778-db0e-11ef-9ab6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"高祐，允之從祖弟。從，才用翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"高祐，允之从祖弟。从，才用翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"ae2fd776-db0e-11ef-abbb-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"薛脩義","people_name_jianti_auto":"薛修义","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"ae2fd77d-db0e-11ef-a99a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"蕭寶寅","people_name_jianti_auto":"萧宝寅","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"ae2fd77e-db0e-11ef-a726-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"龍門","place_name_jianti_auto":"龙门","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"ae2fd77f-db0e-11ef-99dd-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"薛脩義爲龍門鎭將，附蕭寶寅，旣降而反側，故亦被拘。誘，音酉。","note_content_jianti_auto":"薛修义为龙门镇将，附萧宝寅，既降而反侧，故亦被拘。诱，音酉。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":166,"tongjian_id":"ae2fd77c-db0e-11ef-9468-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"敖曹","people_name_jianti_auto":"敖曹","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"ae2fd781-db0e-11ef-b3a5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"敖曹之父以其子昂藏敖曹，故以爲名字。","note_content_jianti_auto":"敖曹之父以其子昂藏敖曹，故以为名字。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":175,"tongjian_id":"ae2fd780-db0e-11ef-a3f3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"齊州","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐州","place_note":"府设历城【山东济南】","resolved_place_entity_id":27,"start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"ae2fd78d-db0e-11ef-87c6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"19魏員外散騎常侍高乾，祐之從子也，與弟敖曹、季式皆喜輕俠，與魏主有舊。爾朱榮之向洛也，逃奔齊州，聞河陰之亂，遂集流民起兵於河、濟之間，受葛榮官爵，頻破州軍。魏主使元欣諭旨，乾等乃降，以乾爲給事黃門侍郞兼武衞將軍，敖曹爲通直散騎侍郞。榮以乾兄弟前爲叛亂，不應復居近要，魏主乃聽解官歸鄕里。敖曹復行抄掠，榮誘執之，與薛脩義同拘於晉陽。敖曹名昂，以字行。","content_fanyi":"北魏员外散骑常侍高乾，是高祐的侄子，与弟弟高敖曹、高季式都崇尚侠义，同魏孝庄帝有旧交。尔朱荣向洛阳进发时，他们逃奔齐州，听说河阴之变后，便聚集流民在黄河、济水之间起兵，接受葛荣授予的官爵，多次击败北魏州郡军队。魏孝庄帝派元欣前来宣布谕旨，高乾等人才归降，朝廷任命高乾为给事黄门侍郎兼武卫将军，任命高敖曹为通直散骑侍郎。尔朱荣认为高乾兄弟以前曾背叛朝廷、发动叛乱，不应再担任近要官职，魏孝庄帝于是听任他们解除官职返回乡里。高敖曹又干起抄掠之事，尔朱荣设计诱捕了他，与薛脩义一同关押在晋阳。高敖曹本名高昂，平时以字行世。","content_jianti_auto":"19魏员外散骑常侍高干，祐之从子也，与弟敖曹、季式皆喜轻侠，与魏主有旧。尔朱荣之向洛也，逃奔齐州，闻河阴之乱，遂集流民起兵于河、济之间，受葛荣官爵，频破州军。魏主使元欣谕旨，干等乃降，以干为给事黄门侍郞兼武衞将军，敖曹为通直散骑侍郞。荣以干兄弟前为叛乱，不应复居近要，魏主乃听解官归鄕里。敖曹复行抄掠，荣诱执之，与薛修义同拘于晋阳。敖曹名昂，以字行。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":14397,"number":19,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百五十二 (梁紀八) / 高祖武皇帝八 / 大通二年 / 第 41 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"ae2fd775-db0e-11ef-a278-a0d3651f611f","year_int":528},"tongjian_id":"ae2fd775-db0e-11ef-a278-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":10}],"page_size":10,"total_pages":6,"total_paragraphs":52},"place_name":"齊州"},"message":"success","success":true}